# ─── Frontend (Vite) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# URL WebSocket (dashboard / `npx convex dev`), p. ej. https://happy-animal-123.convex.cloud
VITE_CONVEX_URL=https://tu-deployment.convex.cloud

# URL HTTP del mismo deployment para rutas en convex/http.ts (termina en .convex.site)
# Ejemplo: https://happy-animal-123.convex.site  → POST https://happy-animal-123.convex.site/agent/send
# Body JSON: { "ownerSessionId": "...", "conversationId": "<id>", "content": "..." }
# VITE_CONVEX_SITE_URL=https://tu-deployment.convex.site

# ─── Convex (Dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables, o CLI) ───────────
# Ejemplos — NO copies secretos reales al repo:
#   npx convex env set OPENAI_API_KEY sk-...
#   npx convex env set OPENAI_MODEL gpt-5.4-mini
#   npx convex env set ALEGRA_API_EMAIL tu_correo_api@empresa.com
#   npx convex env set ALEGRA_API_TOKEN tu_token_de_integracion
